### 📊 HTML Test Reports

After every run, a self-contained HTML report is generated at:

reports/ExtentReport.html

Open it in any browser — no server required.

Each report entry shows:
- ✅ Pass / ❌ Fail / ⏭️ Skip status per test
- Which browser the test ran on
- Failure exception message
- Screenshot of the browser at the exact point of failure
- Timestamps and total execution duration
- Environment panel: project name, tester, base URL

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `ExtentReportManager.java` | Singleton that creates and configures the shared report instance |
| `ExtentReportListener.java` | TestNG listener that hooks into pass/fail/skip events |
| `ScreenshotUtil.java` | Captures and saves a PNG on every test failure |
